            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent-primary)] animate-pulse mr-2"></span>
            Внимание, Акция!
          </div>
          
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-8 leading-tight tracking-tighter" style="font-family: var(--font-heading)">
            Средства №1 от <br/>
